    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><br><strong>a game to see the scenery</strong><br>'CallOfTree' is a first-person shooter game that requires a high-spec PC of a gamer made with Unreal Engine 5.<br>The difficulty level is very easy and the purpose of this game is to see beautiful scenery.<br><br>It's a very simple structure game where you just have to follow the road. Along the road, there are trees you can talk to.<br>The trees will tell you where to go.<br>You have to shoot out the intruders who sometimes appear.<br>It's a story about a gamer who went to another world saving the world.<br><br>First person/3rd person can be changed and stored on a level-by-level basis<br>One level has about 10 minutes of play time<br><br><br>I used the latest version 5.1 of Unreal Engine<br>I tried to add DLSS, but it was put on hold because the usage changed as the Unreal version was upgraded to 5.1<br>Developer computer's RTX3070 produces at least 30 frames and an average of 40 frames with the 2k High option.",
